[LEVEL]
start    = 1, 1         ; cell the player spawns in: 0-based x (column), y (row)
angle    = 90           ; compass bearing: 0 up the grid, 90 right, 180 down, 270 left
end      = 8, 6         ; cell that ends the level
title    = Untitled     ; short mission title
location = Somewhere    ; e.g. Hamburg, Germany
mappos   = 0, 0         ; pixel position on the world map screen

[BRIEFING]
Mission briefing, 100 to 200 words. Consecutive lines are joined with a
space, so wrap them however you like.

A blank line starts a new paragraph.

; Two to five objectives. The first line of each is its title; the rest is a
; 10 to 20 word briefing.
[OBJECTIVE]
First objective title
What the player has to do for it.

[OBJECTIVE]
Second objective title
What the player has to do for it.